<title>FINLAND: FINNISH FEB CONSTRUCTION COSTS RISE 1.7 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>FINNISH FEB CONSTRUCTION COSTS RISE 1.7 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction costs rose 0.1 percent in February on January, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>The construction costs index rose 1.7 percent year-on-year in February, SF said.  </p>
<p>Year-on-year, material input costs rose 1.3 percent and labour input costs rose 3.4 percent. Other input costs fell 0.1 percent, SF said.</p>
<p>Month-on-month, material costs rose 0.1 percent, labour costs rose 0.2 percent and other input costs fell 0.1 percent.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
